---
// DisclaimerBand — quiet page-bottom strip stating the site's limits without ceremony.
// Transcribed from the bundle chrome (components/chrome/SafetyCallout.jsx → DisclaimerBand).
// CLAUDE.md non-negotiable: "educational, not medical advice" must appear near decisions, not
// only buried. This carries the MEDICAL limit only; the one quiet INDEPENDENCE line
// ("Nobody pays us…") lives once in the footer (RULES.md Language: the independence claim is
// ONE line, never repeated) — so the bundle default's trailing independence clause is dropped
// here to avoid duplicating it.
---

<div class="band" role="note">
  <slot>
    Somnary is a reference, not medical advice. It can't know your health history — a pharmacist
    or doctor can.
  </slot>
</div>

<style>
  .band {
    background: var(--surface-sunken);
    border-top: var(--border-w) solid var(--border-hairline);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: var(--leading-body);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
</style>
